msgid "%s (answering)"
msgstr "%s（有应答）"

msgid "%s (no answer)"
msgstr "%s（没应答）"

msgid "%s does not exist, the service cannot start."
msgstr "%s 不存在，服务无法启动。"

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "（空）"

msgid "(no output)"
msgstr "（无输出）"

msgid "(not set in the file)"
msgstr "（文件里没有）"

msgid "(set, hidden)"
msgstr "（已设置）"

msgid "A few items are not reported by the core at all (strict route, DNS mode, ...), so their \"Running\" cell stays empty — only the file and the core log can tell."
msgstr "有几项内核不对外报告（严格路由、DNS 模式等），它们那格只能空着；要确认得看文件和内核日志。"

msgid "A node name is required."
msgstr "需要提供节点名称。"

msgid "Access Secret"
msgstr "访问密钥"

msgid "Active Connections"
msgstr "活动连接"

msgid "Active configuration is invalid"
msgstr "当前配置无效"

msgid "Active configuration is valid"
msgstr "当前配置有效"

msgid "All connections closed."
msgstr "已关闭全部连接。"

msgid "All page settings will be written into the file."
msgstr "将把页面上的全部设置写入文件。"

msgid "Allow LAN"
msgstr "允许局域网"

msgid "Answer AAAA (IPv6) records too."
msgstr "是否同时回答 AAAA（IPv6）解析。"

msgid "Answer AAAA records. Turn off if the tunnel only carries IPv4."
msgstr "是否回答 AAAA（IPv6）解析。隧道只有 IPv4 时建议关闭。"

msgid "Apply failed"
msgstr "应用失败"

msgid "Auto update"
msgstr "自动更新"

msgid "Automatic Route"
msgstr "自动路由"

msgid "Backup not found."
msgstr "备份不存在。"

msgid "Bind Address"
msgstr "绑定地址"

msgid "Chain"
msgstr "链路"

msgid "Check these before starting the service"
msgstr "启动服务前请先确认以下事项"

msgid "Clear Log"
msgstr "清空日志"

msgid "Clear log?"
msgstr "清空日志？"

msgid "Close all"
msgstr "全部断开"

msgid "Configuration File"
msgstr "配置文件"

msgid "Configuration comparison"
msgstr "配置对照"

msgid "Configuration content must not be empty."
msgstr "配置内容不能为空。"

msgid "Configuration file %s is missing. Install the plugin first."
msgstr "配置文件 %s 不存在，请先安装插件。"

msgid "Configuration file is missing"
msgstr "配置文件缺失"

msgid "Configuration file not found."
msgstr "未找到配置文件。"

msgid "Configuration file updated: %d item(s) written — %s"
msgstr "配置文件已更新，写入了 %d 项：%s"

msgid "Configuration history"
msgstr "配置历史"

msgid "Configuration saved"
msgstr "配置已保存"

msgid "Configuration syntax is invalid"
msgstr "配置语法无效"

msgid "Configuration syntax is valid"
msgstr "配置语法有效"

msgid "Connection closed."
msgstr "连接已断开。"

msgid "Controller API secret."
msgstr "控制器 API 密钥。"

msgid "Controller listen address. Keep 127.0.0.1 unless you really need remote access."
msgstr "控制器监听地址，一般保持 127.0.0.1。"

msgid "Controller port."
msgstr "控制器端口。"

msgid "Controller responded with HTTP code %s."
msgstr "控制器返回 HTTP 状态码 %s。"

msgid "Core log"
msgstr "内核日志"

msgid "Create"
msgstr "创建"

msgid "Create a scheduled task for the subscription update."
msgstr "创建定时任务执行订阅更新。"

msgid "Create: the plugin creates the interface, gateway and firewall rule for this interface. Keep: you route the traffic yourself."
msgstr "创建：由插件创建该接口对应的接口、网关与防火墙规则；不创建：路由由你自己处理。"

msgid "DNS Module"
msgstr "DNS 模块"

msgid "DNS hijacking is configured"
msgstr "已配置 DNS 劫持"

msgid "DNS listen address, e.g. 127.0.0.1:1053."
msgstr "DNS 监听地址，如 127.0.0.1:1053。"

msgid "DNS over IPv6"
msgstr "DNS 返回 IPv6"

msgid "DNS queries on port 53 are redirected into mihomo while the service runs. If the proxy is broken, name resolution for all clients behind this firewall breaks with it."
msgstr "服务运行期间，53 端口的 DNS 查询会被重定向到 mihomo。若代理失效，本机后面所有客户端的域名解析也会随之失效。"

msgid "Device MTU."
msgstr "设备 MTU。"

msgid "Device name, must match the firewall rules (default tun_mihomo)."
msgstr "设备名，需与防火墙规则一致（默认 tun_mihomo）。"

msgid "Diff"
msgstr "差异"

msgid "Direct"
msgstr "直连"

msgid "Do not create"
msgstr "不创建"

msgid "Domain sniffing"
msgstr "域名嗅探"

msgid "Download / Upload"
msgstr "下载 / 上传"

msgid "Edit Policy Rule"
msgstr "编辑路由策略"

msgid "Enable mihomo"
msgstr "启用 mihomo"

msgid "Enhanced Mode"
msgstr "增强模式"

msgid "Enter HTTP or HTTPS subscription URL"
msgstr "输入 HTTP 或 HTTPS 订阅地址"

msgid "Enter address and port, e.g. 127.0.0.1:1053."
msgstr "请输入地址与端口，如 127.0.0.1:1053。"

msgid "Enter an IP address, e.g. 127.0.0.1 or 0.0.0.0."
msgstr "请输入 IP，如 127.0.0.1 或 0.0.0.0。"

msgid "Enter an http(s) URL, or leave empty."
msgstr "请输入 http(s) 地址，可留空。"

msgid "Enter dashboard access secret"
msgstr "输入控制面板访问密钥"

msgid "Every 12 hours"
msgstr "每 12 小时"

msgid "Every 6 hours"
msgstr "每 6 小时"

msgid "External Controller"
msgstr "外部控制器"

msgid "External controller has no secret (loopback only)"
msgstr "外部控制器未设置密钥（仅监听本机）"

msgid "External controller is exposed without a secret"
msgstr "外部控制器对外暴露且没有密钥"

msgid "External controller is not configured in the mihomo configuration file."
msgstr "mihomo 配置文件中未设置外部控制器。"

msgid "External controller is reachable from the network"
msgstr "外部控制器可从网络访问"

msgid "Failed to save the subscription settings."
msgstr "保存订阅设置失败。"

msgid "File (config.yaml)"
msgstr "文件（config.yaml）"

msgid "Firewall rule"
msgstr "防火墙规则"

msgid "Firewall rules could not be updated: %s"
msgstr "防火墙规则未能更新：%s"

msgid "Fix these before starting the service"
msgstr "启动服务前请先修正以下问题"

msgid "Foreign only"
msgstr "仅国外"

msgid "Foreign: domestic traffic stays direct. All: everything through the proxy group."
msgstr "仅国外：国内直连，国外走所选出口；全部：所有流量都走所选出口。"

msgid "Group and member are required."
msgstr "需要提供分组与节点名称。"

msgid "How often the scheduled task runs."
msgstr "定时任务的执行频率。"

msgid "IPv6 handling"
msgstr "IPv6 处理"

msgid "IPv6 traffic bypasses the proxy"
msgstr "IPv6 流量不经过代理"

msgid "IPv6 traffic does not go through mihomo (this tunnel only carries IPv4). Open Settings → IPv6 and clear \"IPv6 handling\" to turn it off; otherwise you can ignore this."
msgstr "IPv6 流量不会经过 mihomo（这条通道只管 IPv4）。要关掉就到「设置 → IPv6」把「IPv6 处理」取消勾选；不在意也可以不管。"

msgid "IPv6 traffic does not go through the proxy: the mihomo tunnel only handles IPv4. Add ipv6: false in the configuration if you want IPv6 handled by the normal route, or ignore this."
msgstr "IPv6 流量不会走代理（mihomo 这条通道只管 IPv4）。想让它按普通线路走就在配置里写 ipv6: false；不在意也可以不管。"

msgid "Import failed"
msgstr "导入失败"

msgid "Import from configuration file"
msgstr "从配置文件导入"

msgid "Interface \"%s\" has no IPv4 network; set a source explicitly."
msgstr "接口 \"%s\" 没有 IPv4 网段，请显式填写源。"

msgid "Interface whose traffic goes through mihomo."
msgstr "流量进入 mihomo 的物理接口。"

msgid "Invalid log level."
msgstr "无效的日志层级。"

msgid "Invalid mode."
msgstr "无效的模式。"

msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

msgid "Keep the TUN device above other default routes."
msgstr "保持 TUN 设备优先于其它默认路由。"

msgid "Let local clients use the proxy ports directly."
msgstr "允许局域网客户端直接使用代理端口。"

msgid "Let mihomo resolve DNS itself (required for fake-ip)."
msgstr "由 mihomo 解析 DNS（fake-ip 需要）。"

msgid "Let the core handle IPv6 traffic."
msgstr "是否让内核处理 IPv6 流量。"

msgid "Let the core handle IPv6. Off = IPv6 traffic stays on the normal route (current design)."
msgstr "让内核处理 IPv6 流量。关闭 = IPv6 照常走普通线路（当前设计如此）。"

msgid "Loading …"
msgstr "加载中 …"

msgid "Log Viewer"
msgstr "日志视图"

msgid "Log file cleared."
msgstr "日志已清空。"

msgid "Log verbosity. Use error or silent for long term operation."
msgstr "日志级别；长期运行建议 error 或 silent。"

msgid "Manual: make sure the interface is policy routed into the TUN device."
msgstr "手动模式：请自行确保该接口的策略路由指向 TUN 设备。"

msgid "Memory / Core Version"
msgstr "内存 / 内核版本"

msgid "Mihomo"
msgstr "Mihomo"

msgid "Mixed port"
msgstr "混合端口"

msgid "Mode switched to %s."
msgstr "已切换到 %s 模式。"

msgid "No interface is bound to mihomo right now, so the file contains no plugin-managed rules."
msgstr "现在没有任何接口走 mihomo，所以文件里也没有插件替你维护的规则。"

msgid "No output from the configuration test."
msgstr "配置校验没有输出。"

msgid "No proxy groups are defined in the configuration."
msgstr "配置中未定义代理分组。"

msgid "No rule would be generated: every row is disabled, has no source, or has no outbound selected."
msgstr "不会生成任何规则：所有行要么未启用、要么没有源、要么没有选出站。"

msgid "Nothing is bound yet — click Add, pick an interface and a proxy group, then Apply."
msgstr "还没有绑定接口 —— 点「添加」选择接口与代理组，再点「应用」生效。"

msgid "Nothing to test: no enabled row requests a firewall rule."
msgstr "无可自检项：没有启用且要求创建防火墙规则的行。"

msgid "Nothing was changed on this page, so the file was left alone."
msgstr "本次没有改动任何设置，文件保持原样。"

msgid "OPNsense changes"
msgstr "OPNsense 变更"

msgid "On the next reboot mihomo will take over routing as soon as it starts. Verify the configuration before you reboot."
msgstr "下次重启后 mihomo 一启动就会接管路由。重启前请先确认配置无误。"

msgid "Only HTTP or HTTPS subscription URLs are allowed."
msgstr "订阅地址仅允许使用 HTTP 或 HTTPS。"

msgid "Optional. Empty uses the interface network."
msgstr "可留空，默认使用接口网段。"

msgid "POST required."
msgstr "需要 POST 请求。"

msgid "Pick an interface, e.g. lan or opt2."
msgstr "请选择接口，例如 lan 或 opt2。"

msgid "Placeholder proxy nodes detected"
msgstr "检测到占位节点"

msgid "Policy Routing"
msgstr "路由策略"

msgid "Policy routing is active"
msgstr "策略路由已启用"

msgid "Policy routing is in place."
msgstr "策略路由已就位。"

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "预览"

msgid "Proxy Groups"
msgstr "代理分组"

msgid "Proxy Suite"
msgstr "Proxy Suite"

msgid "Proxy group"
msgstr "代理组"

msgid "Proxy group \"%s\" does not exist in the current configuration file."
msgstr "代理组 \"%s\" 不在当前配置文件里。"

msgid "Proxy group name."
msgstr "代理组名。"

msgid "Recover domains from TLS SNI, required for domain based rules on routed traffic."
msgstr "从 TLS SNI 还原域名；被路由的流量要用域名规则时必须开启。"

msgid "Recover domains from TLS SNI. Required for domain based rules on routed traffic."
msgstr "从 TLS SNI 还原域名；被路由的流量要用域名规则时必须开启。"

msgid "Restart After Update"
msgstr "更新后重启"

msgid "Restart service after a successful update"
msgstr "更新成功后重启服务"

msgid "Restart service?"
msgstr "重启服务？"

msgid "Restart the service after a successful update."
msgstr "更新成功后重启服务。"

msgid "Restart the service after applying"
msgstr "应用后重启服务"

msgid "Restore this configuration backup? The current file is backed up first and the result is validated with mihomo -t."
msgstr "要用这份备份覆盖当前配置吗？当前文件会先自动备份，结果会用 mihomo -t 校验。"

msgid "Restores the most recent config.xml backup created by this plugin and reloads the firewall."
msgstr "将还原本插件最近一次创建的 config.xml 备份，并重新加载防火墙。"

msgid "Route traffic into mihomo through a virtual device."
msgstr "用虚拟网卡把流量导入 mihomo。"

msgid "Running (memory)"
msgstr "运行中（内存）"

msgid "SOCKS port"
msgstr "SOCKS 端口"

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "保存失败"

msgid "Scheduled task could not be updated: %s"
msgstr "定时任务更新失败：%s"

msgid "Scheduled task enabled: subscription update (%s)."
msgstr "定时任务已启用：订阅更新（%s）。"

msgid "Scheduled task removed: subscription update."
msgstr "定时任务已删除：订阅更新。"

msgid "Scope"
msgstr "规则范围"

msgid "Secret written into the generated configuration."
msgstr "写入生成配置的密钥。"

msgid "Service is enabled at boot but not running"
msgstr "已设置为开机自启，但当前未运行"

msgid "Service is not enabled; nothing to restart."
msgstr "服务未启用，无需重启。"

msgid "Service is running and enabled at boot"
msgstr "服务正在运行且已开机自启"

msgid "Service restart requested."
msgstr "已请求重启服务。"

msgid "Service will not start automatically on boot."
msgstr "服务不会在开机时自动启动。"

msgid "Service will start automatically on boot."
msgstr "服务将在开机时自动启动。"

msgid "Set a subscription URL before starting an update."
msgstr "请先设置订阅地址再执行更新。"

msgid "Settings applied"
msgstr "设置已应用"

msgid "Settings imported"
msgstr "设置已导入"

msgid "Settings imported from the active configuration."
msgstr "已从当前配置导入设置。"

msgid "Settings saved"
msgstr "设置已保存"

msgid "Stack"
msgstr "协议栈"

msgid "Start Subscription"
msgstr "开始订阅"

msgid "Start the service at boot."
msgstr "开机时启动服务。"

msgid "Starting the service will insert routes for all IPv4 traffic into the TUN device. If the proxy nodes are not reachable or not configured, every device behind this firewall loses Internet access."
msgstr "启动服务会把所有 IPv4 流量的路由指向 TUN 设备。若节点不可达或尚未配置，本机后面所有设备都会失去网络。"

msgid "Strict Route"
msgstr "严格路由"

msgid "Strict route is enabled"
msgstr "已启用严格路由"

msgid "Subscription Management"
msgstr "订阅管理"

msgid "Subscription URL"
msgstr "订阅地址"

msgid "Subscription URL, stored in the plugin environment file."
msgstr "订阅地址，保存在插件环境文件中。"

msgid "Subscription log"
msgstr "订阅日志"

msgid "Subscription settings saved."
msgstr "订阅设置已保存。"

msgid "Subscription task submitted; follow the log for progress."
msgstr "订阅任务已提交，请查看日志了解进度。"

msgid "Subscription update failed"
msgstr "订阅更新失败"

msgid "Subscription update started"
msgstr "订阅更新已开始"

msgid "Switched \"%s\" to \"%s\"."
msgstr "已将 \"%s\" 切换到 \"%s\"。"

msgid "TUN Device"
msgstr "TUN 设备"

msgid "TUN Mode"
msgstr "TUN 模式"

msgid "TUN is disabled: these rules are written and validated, but no traffic reaches mihomo yet."
msgstr "TUN 已关闭：规则会写入并通过校验，但暂时没有流量进入 mihomo。"

msgid "TUN is disabled: traffic does not reach mihomo."
msgstr "TUN 已关闭：流量不会进入 mihomo。"

msgid "TUN mode is enabled (automatic route takeover off)"
msgstr "已启用 TUN 模式（未自动接管路由）"

msgid "TUN off"
msgstr "TUN 未启用"

msgid "TUN with automatic route takeover is enabled"
msgstr "已启用 TUN 且自动接管路由"

msgid "Take over the default route. Without working proxy nodes this cuts the network off."
msgstr "接管默认路由；节点不可用时会断网。"

msgid "Test Active Configuration"
msgstr "校验当前配置"

msgid "The \"Running\" column is what the core is using right now. Change the file and you still have to restart the service before it shows up here."
msgstr "「运行中」那一列是内核现在真的在用的值。改完文件还得重启服务，这里才会变。"

msgid "The TUN device is guaranteed to win over other default routes while the service runs."
msgstr "服务运行时，TUN 设备将优先于其它默认路由。"

msgid "The configuration file was not written. mihomo rejected it:%s"
msgstr "配置文件未写入，mihomo 校验未通过：%s"

msgid "The configuration still contains the placeholder server 88.88.88.88 shipped with the plugin. Replace it with a real subscription or real proxy nodes before starting the service."
msgstr "配置里仍是随包分发的占位服务器 88.88.88.88。请在启动服务前换成真实订阅或真实节点。"

msgid "The controller is not reachable. Start the service to see proxy groups."
msgstr "控制器不可达；启动服务后可查看代理分组。"

msgid "The controller is reachable from the network and has no secret, so anyone who can reach it may reconfigure the proxy. Set a secret or bind it to 127.0.0.1."
msgstr "控制器对网络开放且未设密钥，任何能访问它的人都能改代理配置。请设置密钥，或改为只监听 127.0.0.1。"

msgid "The controller listens on 127.0.0.1, so it cannot be reached from the network. A secret is only needed when you bind the controller to a network address."
msgstr "控制器只监听 127.0.0.1，网络侧访问不到；只有把它绑到网络地址时才需要密钥。"

msgid "The file contains a block of rules that the plugin keeps up to date (from the Policy Routing page). Do not edit inside that block: it gets replaced as a whole."
msgstr "文件里有一段是插件替你维护的规则（来自「路由策略」页）。别手动改这一段，它会被整段替换。"

msgid "The firewall rules written by this attempt have been removed, so nothing is bound."
msgstr "本次写入的防火墙规则已撤销，当前没有任何接口被绑定。"

msgid "The page and the file disagree on %d item(s), but you did not touch them, so they were left as they are: %s — press Import to use the file values in the page, or pick \"takes precedence\" to write them."
msgstr "还有 %d 项页面和文件对不上，但你这次没改，所以文件里没动它们：%s —— 想用文件里的值刷新页面就点「从配置导入」；想以页面为准就选「全部写入文件」。"

msgid "The page and the file disagree on some items: press Apply to write what the page says into the file, or press Import to load what the file says into the page."
msgstr "有几项页面和文件对不上：点「应用」就是把页面里的值写进文件；点「从配置导入」则相反，用文件里的值刷新页面。"

msgid "The running service cannot be read right now (stopped, or the secret does not match), so only the page and the file are compared here."
msgstr "现在读不到运行中的服务（可能是没启动，或密钥对不上），所以这里只对比页面和文件。"

msgid "The running service keeps its current in-memory configuration until it is restarted."
msgstr "运行中的服务在重启前仍使用内存中的旧配置。"

msgid "The same setting can live in three places. This table shows all three: what the WebGUI remembers, what the file says, and what the running core actually uses."
msgstr "同一个设置可能同时存在于三个地方。下表把它们列在一起：页面的记忆、文件里写的、内核此刻真正在用的。"

msgid "The selected log file will be emptied."
msgstr "选中的日志文件将被清空。"

msgid "The service is not enabled at boot."
msgstr "服务未设置为开机自启。"

msgid "The service is stopped. Use the start button in the page header to bring it up."
msgstr "服务已停止，可用页面右上角的启动按钮将其拉起。"

msgid "The service will be restarted right after the update, which rebuilds the TUN device and its routes. Make sure the new nodes work, otherwise clients behind this firewall may lose connectivity."
msgstr "更新后会立即重启服务，这会重建 TUN 设备及其路由。请确认新节点可用，否则本机后面的客户端可能断网。"

msgid "The subscription script is not installed; subscription updates are unavailable."
msgstr "未安装订阅脚本，无法执行订阅更新。"

msgid "This config.yaml is hand-written, not generated from the subscription template. Updating the subscription replaces the whole file, so your own edits would be gone — do not use it, or take a backup first."
msgstr "你这份 config.yaml 是自己写的（不是订阅生成的）。点「更新订阅」会把整份文件换成订阅模板的内容，自己写的就没了 —— 想保留就别点它，或者先备份。"

msgid "Total Downloaded / Uploaded"
msgstr "累计下载 / 上传"

msgid "Traffic exits through this group. Ignored for the direct scope."
msgstr "流量从该代理组出去；范围为「直连」时忽略。"

msgid "Traffic from these interfaces is routed into the mihomo TUN device: %s. While the service is stopped or fails to start, clients on these interfaces lose Internet access."
msgstr "这些接口的流量会被策略路由进 mihomo 的 TUN 设备：%s。在服务停止或启动失败期间，这些接口上的客户端会断网。"

msgid "Traffic only enters the TUN device when firewall or policy routing sends it there."
msgstr "仅当防火墙或策略路由把流量送入 TUN 设备时才会走代理。"

msgid "Unable to create a staging file in /tmp."
msgstr "无法在 /tmp 创建临时文件。"

msgid "Unable to reach the mihomo external controller."
msgstr "无法连接 mihomo 外部控制器。"

msgid "Unable to write the staging file."
msgstr "无法写入临时文件。"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

msgid "Undo network changes"
msgstr "撤销网络配置"

msgid "Unknown log file."
msgstr "未知的日志文件。"

msgid "Up to 128 characters: letters, digits, \".\", \"-\" and \"_\"."
msgstr "最多 128 字符：字母、数字与 . - _。"

msgid "Up to 15 characters: letters, digits, underscore."
msgstr "最多 15 字符：字母、数字、下划线。"

msgid "Update the subscription on a schedule."
msgstr "按计划更新订阅。"

msgid "Updating the subscription rebuilds config.yaml from the subscription template, so manual edits are replaced. The current file is backed up as config.yaml.bak.sub_* first."
msgstr "更新订阅会用订阅模板整份重写 config.yaml，手工改过的内容会被替换；更新前会自动备份成 config.yaml.bak.sub_*。"

msgid "Use %sSettings%s to enable it, then start it from the controls in the page header."
msgstr "请到 %s设置%s 中启用，然后使用页面右上角的控件启动。"

msgid "Validate"
msgstr "校验"

msgid "Validated with mihomo -t before it replaces the active file; the previous file is kept as a backup."
msgstr "保存前用 mihomo -t 校验；原文件保留为备份。"

msgid "Validation failed"
msgstr "校验未通过"

msgid "Validation passed"
msgstr "校验通过"

msgid "Waiting for the OPNsense side: interface, gateway and policy routing rule."
msgstr "等待同步 OPNsense 网络侧：接口、网关与策略路由规则。"

msgid "WebGUI"
msgstr "页面（设置）"

msgid "Will be written"
msgstr "将写入"

msgid "Write all page settings into the file"
msgstr "以页面为准，全部写入文件"

msgid "Write only what I changed (recommended)"
msgstr "只写入我改过的项（推荐）"

msgid "Writes the mihomo configuration and, where needed, creates the interface, gateway and firewall rule on OPNsense. config.xml is backed up first."
msgstr "写入 mihomo 配置；需要时在 OPNsense 上创建接口、网关和防火墙规则（先备份 config.xml）。"

msgid "You have not changed anything yet — pressing Apply will not write to the file."
msgstr "你还没改任何项 —— 现在点「应用」不会写文件。"

msgid "apply to take effect"
msgstr "应用后生效"

msgid "bytes"
msgstr "字节"

msgid "checked by the core"
msgstr "内核会校验密钥"

msgid "consistent"
msgstr "一致"

msgid "current"
msgstr "当前"

msgid "different"
msgstr "不一致"

msgid "domestic"
msgstr "国内"

msgid "exit IP"
msgstr "出口 IP"

msgid "external-controller is bound to %s. Anyone who can reach that address and knows the secret can reconfigure the proxy. Bind it to 127.0.0.1 — this WebGUI talks to the controller over the loopback interface only."
msgstr "external-controller 绑定在 %s。任何能访问该地址并知道密钥的人都能改代理配置。建议改为 127.0.0.1 —— 本 WebGUI 只通过回环接口与控制器通信。"

msgid "fake-ip returns synthetic addresses, redir-host returns real ones."
msgstr "fake-ip 返回合成地址；redir-host 返回真实地址。"

msgid "gvisor is recommended on FreeBSD."
msgstr "FreeBSD 下建议 gvisor。"

msgid "in effect"
msgstr "生效中"

msgid "mihomo is active and will start again after a reboot."
msgstr "mihomo 正在运行，并会在重启后自动启动。"

msgid "mihomo rules"
msgstr "mihomo 规则"

msgid "not checked (no secret)"
msgstr "没设密钥，内核不校验"

msgid "not in file"
msgstr "文件未写"

msgid "not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "nothing bound"
msgstr "未绑定任何接口"

msgid "rule"
msgstr "规则"

msgid "rule: follow the routing rules. global: everything through the selected proxy. direct: no proxy."
msgstr "rule：按规则分流；global：全部走所选节点；direct：全部直连。"

msgid "running only"
msgstr "仅运行值"

msgid "…"
msgstr "未知"
